  "question": {
    "text": "Four solid spheres each of diameter <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;and mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>0.5</mtext><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> are placed with their centres at the corners of a square of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The moment of inertia of the system about the diagonal of the square is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>r</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>d</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>cm</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>m</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>0.5</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0008_c55a4f94f9c3.jpg\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>XX</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Substituting the values, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>XX</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>"
  }
